---

<section class="projects-section">
	<div class="section-container">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">Projects</h2>
			<p class="section-subtitle">數位創作實驗室</p>
		</div>

		<div class="projects-grid">
			<div class="project-card">
				<div class="card-content">
					<h3 class="project-title">NCU App</h3>
					<p class="project-description">
						還記得大學時期那些繁瑣的校園事務嗎？我們做了一個 App 讓中央大學的同學們生活更輕鬆，也讓校園更有凝聚力。因為誰說校園 App 一定要很無聊？
					</p>
					<a href="https://ncuappteam.github.io/" target="_blank" class="project-link">查看專案 →</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="project-card">
				<div class="card-content">
					<h3 class="project-title">tl;dw - Too Long Don't Wait</h3>
					<p class="project-description">
						在舊金山灣區生病了？別再盲目地跑急診室了！這個 AI 預測工具告訴你哪家醫院等待時間最短。黑客松得獎作品，因為我們相信科技應該讓看病變得更人性化。
					</p>
					<a href="https://apps.healthuniverse.com/oop-gbj-tdp/" target="_blank" class="project-link">查看 Demo →</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="project-card">
				<div class="card-content">
					<h3 class="project-title">Self-Diagnosis</h3>
					<p class="project-description">
						「醫生，我這裡痛痛的...」聽起來很熟悉嗎？這個聊天機器人展示了 AI 如何幫助你初步了解症狀，當然，它不會取代真正的醫生，但至少能讓你不再瞎緊張！
					</p>
					<a href="https://davidday.tw/self-diagnose/" target="_blank" class="project-link">查看 Demo →</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="project-card">
				<div class="card-content">
					<h3 class="project-title">MIDI-MUG</h3>
					<p class="project-description">
						誰說學鋼琴一定要花大錢？用你的 MIDI 鍵盤就能玩音樂遊戲！這是我對 Synthesia 的開源致敬，因為音樂學習應該是免費且有趣的。
					</p>
					<a href="https://github.com/daviddaytw/MIDI-MUG" target="_blank" class="project-link">查看程式碼 →</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="project-card">
				<div class="card-content">
					<h3 class="project-title">PLAN-ADAM</h3>
					<p class="project-description">
						想當太空建築師嗎？在這個網頁遊戲裡，你可以建造屬於自己的星球，然後在上面探險！寓教於樂，讓學習變成一場星際冒險。
					</p>
					<a href="https://site.chuan.one/" target="_blank" class="project-link">線上遊玩 →</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.projects-section {
		min-height: 100vh;
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
		padding: 6rem 2rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.section-container {
		max-width: 1400px;
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.section-header {
		margin-bottom: 5rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
		font-weight: 300;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		line-height: 1;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #fff;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
		font-weight: 200;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 0.7;
		margin: 0;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}

	.projects-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.project-card {
		background: #000;
		border: 2px solid #fff;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
		position: relative;
	}

	.project-card::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		bottom: 0;
		background: #fff;
		transform: scaleX(0);
		transform-origin: left;
		transition: transform 0.3s ease;
		z-index: 0;
	}

	.project-card:hover::before {
		transform: scaleX(1);
	}

	.project-card:hover {
		border-color: #000;
	}

	.project-card:hover .card-content,
	.project-card:hover .project-title,
	.project-card:hover .project-description,
	.project-card:hover .project-link {
		color: #000;
	}

	.card-content {
		padding: 3rem;
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.project-title {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
		color: #fff;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
		padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
		display: inline-block;
	}

	.project-card:hover .project-title {
		border-bottom-color: #000;
	}

	.project-description {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 0.9;
		margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.project-link {
		display: inline-block;
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 1rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		border: 2px solid #fff;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.project-card:hover .project-link {
		color: #000;
		border-color: #000;
		background: #000;
	}

	.project-card:hover .project-link:hover {
		background: #fff;
		color: #000;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.projects-section {
			padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
		}

		.section-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}

		.projects-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}

		.card-content {
			padding: 2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
